        <p>ON! is specifically marketed toward active users. The slim format sits invisibly, and the balanced 8mg delivers noticeable cognitive benefit without excessive cardiac stress. Menthol-forward profile appeals to athletes. ON! pouches are engineered for durability during intense exercise. Best for: tactical sports (tennis, basketball), strength training, endurance athletes.</p>

